    "name": "CS-301L Lab 09 - Security, Middleware, Guards and Pipes",
    "description": "Task-wise API tests for the standalone Lab 09 NestJS implementation. Import the matching Lab09 Local environment and run requests in order. The login requests store userToken/adminToken automatically. Restart the API before repeating Task 5 so the seeded demo password is reset.",
